# Object Property: <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/RO_0002178> (supplies)

AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/RO_0002178> "Relation between an arterial structure and another structure, where the arterial structure acts as a conduit channeling fluid, substance or energy.")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/RO_0002178> "supplies"@en)
SubObjectPropertyOf(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/RO_0002178> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/RO_0002170>)

# Object Property: <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/RO_0002179> (drains)

AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/RO_0002179> "Relation between an collecting structure and another structure, where the collecting structure acts as a conduit channeling fluid, substance or energy away from the other structure.")
