# Object Property: <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/RO_0002570> (conduit for)

AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/RO_0002570> "x is a conduit for y iff y overlaps through the lumen_of of x, and y has parts on either side of the lumen of x.")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/RO_0002570> "conduit for")
SubObjectPropertyOf(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/RO_0002570> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/RO_0002131>)
ObjectPropertyDomain(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/RO_0002570> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000040>)
