AnnotationAssertion(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasExactSynonym> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/CL_0019001> "serous cell of tracheobronchial tree")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/CL_0019001> "tracheobronchial serous cell"@en)
