AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:comment <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/GO_0007143> "Note that female germ lines can be found in female or hermaphroditic organisms, so this term can be used to annotate gene products from hermaphrodites such as those of C. elegans. See also the biological process term 'meiotic nuclear division; GO:0140013'.")
