AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:comment <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/GO_0007409> "Note that 'axonogenesis' differs from 'axon development' in that the latter also covers other processes, such as axon regeneration (regrowth after loss or damage, not necessarily of the whole axon).")
