AnnotationAssertion(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasExactSynonym> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/GO_0097014> "cilium plasm")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:comment <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/GO_0097014> "Note that we deem cilium and microtubule-based flagellum to be equivalent. Also, researchers consider the composition of both the plasm and the membrane of the cilium to be detectably different from that in the non-ciliary cytosol and plasma membrane (e.g. in terms of calcium ion concentration, membrane lipid composition, and more). For this reason, the term \"ciliary plasm\" is not linked to \"cytoplasm\".")
