DisjointClasses(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/PATO_0070016> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/PATO_0070017>)

# Class: <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/PATO_0070017> (standard pyramidal morphology)

