AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:comment <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/UBERON_0002436> "In some species, parcellations of lobes are not well defined if at all. The primary visual cortex being part of the occiptal lobe hence could refer to it being part of the most posterior region of the mammalian cerebral cortex.")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/UBERON_0002436> "primary visual cortex")
